cess</a></li><li class=\"more\"><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">他 More</a><div class=\"dd\"><div><h4>Café</h4><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:menu}}\">Menu</a><a href=\"{{p:morning}}\">Morning set</a><a href=\"{{p:beans}}\">Roasted beans</a></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href=\"{{p:story}}\">Our story</a><a href=\"{{p:gallery}}\">Gallery</a><a href=\"{{p:news}}\">Notice board</a></div><div><h4>Visit</h4><a href=\"{{p:access}}\">Access & hours</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></div></div></li></ul><span class=\"ks-sign\" id=\"ks-sign\">営業中</span><details class=\"ks-m\"><summary>MENU</summary><nav><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:menu}}\">Menu</a><a href=\"{{p:morning}}\">Morning set</a><a href=\"{{p:beans}}\">Roasted beans</a><a href=\"{{p:story}}\">Our story</a><a href=\"{{p:gallery}}\">Gallery</a><a href=\"{{p:news}}\">Notice board</a><a href=\"{{p:access}}\">Access & hours</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></nav></details></header>","foot":"<footer class=\"ks-foot\"><div class=\"top\"><div><div class=\"big\">喫茶 まるよ</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;opacity:.85\">Siphon coffee, hot sandwiches and cream soda since 1974. Template demo content.</p></div><div class=\"cols\"><div><h4>Café</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:menu}}\">Menu</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:morning}}\">Morning set</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:beans}}\">Roasted beans</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:story}}\">Our story</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:gallery}}\">Gallery</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:news}}\">Notice board</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Visit</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:access}}\">Access & hours</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"copy\">© 2026 KISSA MARUYO · OPEN 07:00–18:00 · CLOSED MONDAYS</div></footer><script>(function(){var s=document.getElementById(\"ks-sign\");if(!s)return;var d=new Date(),h=d.getHours()+d.getMinutes()/60,o=d.getDay()!==1&&h>=7&&h<18;s.textContent=o?\"営業中\":(d.getDay()===1?\"定休日\":\"準備中\");s.className=\"ks-sign\"+(o?\"\":\" off\")})();</script>","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"ks-hero\"><div class=\"ks-board\"><span class=\"ks-stick\">朝7時<br>から</span><span class=\"sub\">SIPHON COFFEE · TOAST · CREAM SODA</span><h1>珈琲と、<br>ひと休み。</h1>\n<div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Blend coffee <small>ブレンド</small></span><i></i><b>RM 9</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Hot egg sandwich <small>玉子サンド</small></span><i></i><b>RM 14</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Napolitan <small>ナポリタン</small></span><i></i><b>RM 18</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Cream soda <small>クリームソーダ</small></span><i></i><b>RM 13</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Pudding à la mode <small>プリンアラモード</small></span><i></i><b>RM 16</b></div>\n<div class=\"ks-today\"><span>TODAY'S SPECIAL · 本日のおすすめ</span><b id=\"ks-sp\">—</b><em id=\"ks-sd\"></em></div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"ks-btn\" href=\"{{p:menu}}\">全メニュー</a><a class=\"ks-btn o\" href=\"{{p:access}}\">場所と営業時間</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"ks-ph\" data-l=\"Counter & siphon, afternoon light (缺图)\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-hd\"><h2>モーニング</h2></div><div class=\"ks-3\"><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">A</span><h3>Toast set</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 12</span><p>Thick toast, butter, boiled egg and a cup of blend. Until 11:00.</p></div><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">B</span><h3>Egg sandwich set</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 16</span><p>Fluffy omelette sandwich, small salad, blend or milk tea.</p></div><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">C</span><h3>Rice &amp; miso</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 15</span><p>Grilled fish, rice, miso soup. For people who want breakfast to be breakfast.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-split\"><div class=\"ks-ph\" data-l=\"Hand-drip, close (缺图)\"></div><div><h2>一杯ずつ、ネルドリップ。</h2><p>Every cup is dripped by hand through a flannel filter, the way the founder did it in 1974. We roast in small batches on the premises and serve each pot within the hour.</p><p style=\"margin-top:24px\"><a class=\"ks-btn o\" href=\"{{p:story}}\">お店のこと</a></p></div></div></section><script>(function(){var A=[[\"Napolitan Set\",\"Sunday: ketchup spaghetti, salad and a small coffee. RM 22\"],[\"Closed\",\"Monday is our rest day.\"],[\"Curry rice\",\"Tuesday: beef curry, 6-hour onions. RM 20\"],[\"Hot sand + soda\",\"Wednesday: toasted ham & cheese with cream soda. RM 24\"],[\"Katsu sando\",\"Thursday: pork cutlet, cabbage, brown sauce. RM 22\"],[\"Pudding set\",\"Friday: pudding à la mode plus any drink. RM 22\"],[\"Pancake stack\",\"Saturday: three fluffy pancakes, butter and maple. RM 20\"]],d=new Date().getDay(),a=A[d],t=document.getElementById(\"ks-sp\"),e=document.getElementById(\"ks-sd\");if(t){t.textContent=a[0];e.textContent=a[1]}})();</script>","menu":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Menu</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">お品書き</h1><p class=\"lead\">Prices in RM. Everything is made to order, so please allow a little time.</p></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-menu\"><div><h3>珈琲 Coffee</h3><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Blend <small>ブレンド</small></span><i></i><b>9</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Siphon coffee <small>サイフォン</small></span><i></i><b>14</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Café au lait <small>カフェオレ</small></span><i></i><b>11</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Iced coffee <small>アイスコーヒー</small></span><i></i><b>10</b></div><h3>ソフトドリンク</h3><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Cream soda <small>クリームソーダ</small></span><i></i><b>13</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Milk tea <small>ミルクティー</small></span><i></i><b>10</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Orange juice <small>オレンジジュース</small></span><i></i><b>9</b></div></div><div><h3>軽食 Food</h3><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Hot egg sandwich <small>玉子サンド</small></span><i></i><b>14</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Napolitan <small>ナポリタン</small></span><i></i><b>18</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Curry rice <small>カレーライス</small></span><i></i><b>18</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Toast & butter <small>トースト</small></span><i></i><b>8</b></div><h3>甘味 Sweets</h3><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Pudding à la mode <small>プリンアラモード</small></span><i></i><b>16</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Hot cake <small>ホットケーキ</small></span><i></i><b>14</b></div><div class=\"ks-it\"><span>Coffee jelly <small>コーヒーゼリー</small></span><i></i><b>10</b></div></div></div></section>","morning":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Morning set</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">モーニング</h1><p class=\"lead\">Served 07:00–11:00, every day we're open.</p></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-3\"><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">A</span><h3>Toast set</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 12</span><p>Thick toast, butter, boiled egg, coffee or tea.</p></div><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">B</span><h3>Egg sandwich set</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 16</span><p>Omelette sandwich, salad, coffee or tea.</p></div><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">C</span><h3>Rice &amp; miso</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 15</span><p>Grilled fish, rice, miso soup, pickles.</p></div></div></section>","beans":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Roasted beans</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">珈琲豆</h1><p class=\"lead\">Roasted on Fridays, packed on Saturdays. Order online or pick up in the shop.</p></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-3\"><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">浅煎り</span><div class=\"ks-ph\" style=\"min-height:160px\" data-l=\"Light roast bag (缺图)\"></div><h3>Morning blend</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 38 / 200 g</span><p>Bright and clean. Good for toast and for people who dislike bitterness.</p></div><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">中煎り</span><div class=\"ks-ph\" style=\"min-height:160px\" data-l=\"Medium roast bag (缺图)\"></div><h3>Maruyo blend</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 42 / 200 g</span><p>Our house cup since 1974. Round, nutty, slightly sweet.</p></div><div class=\"ks-card\"><span class=\"tag\">深煎り</span><div class=\"ks-ph\" style=\"min-height:160px\" data-l=\"Dark roast bag (缺图)\"></div><h3>Night blend</h3><span class=\"pr\">RM 44 / 200 g</span><p>Dark and heavy. Made for milk, or for the last cup of the day.</p></div></div></section>","story":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Our story</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">お店のこと</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-split\"><div class=\"ks-ph\" style=\"min-height:360px\" data-l=\"Founder at the counter, 1974 (缺图)\"></div><div><h2>1974年、六席から。</h2><p>Maruyo opened with six seats, one siphon and a radio. Fifty years on we still have the six seats, and the radio still plays the same station. Replace this with your shop's real history.</p></div></div></section>","gallery":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Gallery</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">写真</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-gal\"><div class=\"ks-ph w\" data-l=\"Counter (缺图)\"></div><div class=\"ks-ph\" data-l=\"Soda (缺图)\"></div><div class=\"ks-ph\" data-l=\"Cups (缺图)\"></div><div class=\"ks-ph\" data-l=\"Siphon (缺图)\"></div><div class=\"ks-ph w\" data-l=\"Window seat (缺图)\"></div><div class=\"ks-ph\" data-l=\"Pudding (缺图)\"></div></div></section>","news":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Notice board</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">お知らせ</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><a class=\"ks-note\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.10.01</time><h3>Autumn menu: chestnut pudding and sweet-potato latte</h3></a><a class=\"ks-note\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.09.15</time><h3>Closed 22–23 Sep for roaster maintenance</h3></a><a class=\"ks-note\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.08.30</time><h3>Cream soda in four colours, until the end of summer</h3></a><a class=\"ks-note\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.07.12</time><h3>Beans now ship nationwide</h3></a></section>","access":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Access & hours</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">場所と営業時間</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"ks-split\"><table class=\"ks-hours\"><tr><th>Mon</th><td>定休日 · Closed</td></tr><tr><th>Tue – Fri</th><td>07:00 – 18:00</td></tr><tr><th>Sat – Sun</th><td>07:30 – 18:00</td></tr><tr><th>Last order</th><td>17:30</td></tr></table><div><div class=\"ks-ph\" style=\"min-height:260px\" data-l=\"Map (缺图)\"></div><p style=\"margin-top:16px;line-height:1.9\">12 Jalan Contoh, 50000 Kuala Lumpur (replace). Two minutes from the station, behind the pharmacy. Six seats, no reservations.</p></div></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">よくある質問</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Can I reserve a seat?</summary><p>We have six seats and don't take reservations. Groups of four or more, please call.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have decaf?</summary><p>Yes, one decaf blend, by the cup or the bag.</p></details><details><summary>Can I work on a laptop?</summary><p>For an hour at the counter when it's quiet. Weekends, please leave it at home.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(60px,10vw,140px)\"><div class=\"ks-sign\" style=\"display:inline-grid;margin-bottom:20px\">準備中</div><h1 style=\"font:400 clamp(70px,14vw,180px) var(--f-head)\">404</h1><h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 26px;font:400 28px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.1em\">そのページは売り切れです。</h2><a class=\"ks-btn\" href=\"{{p:home}}\">TOPへ戻る</a></section>"}}